NOTE ON SCOPE / 适用范围说明

This license applies **only** to the original code, documentation and other
content contained in this repository (`dive/`, `labs/`, `docs/`, `tests/`,
`README.md`, `run_all_labs.sh`).

本许可证仅适用于本仓库自身的原创内容（`dive/`、`labs/`、`docs/`、`tests/`、
`README.md`、`run_all_labs.sh`）。

This repository is an independent, original companion implementation that
follows the *curriculum outline* of the open-source course 《动手学大模型
Dive into LLMs》 (https://github.com/Lordog/dive-into-llms) by the team of
Prof. Zhuosheng Zhang (张倬胜) at Shanghai Jiao Tong University. No text, code,
slides, notebooks or figures from that upstream repository are copied,
redistributed or derived from here — it is credited and linked as a reference
only. The upstream repository carries no license file, and its authors retain
all rights to their own materials.

本仓库是一份独立的原创配套实现，仅遵循上海交通大学张倬胜老师团队开源课程
《动手学大模型 Dive into LLMs》（https://github.com/Lordog/dive-into-llms）
的**大纲顺序**。本仓库**没有**复制、再分发或改编上游仓库的任何文字、代码、
课件、notebook 或图片，仅以引用和致谢的形式链接到上游。上游仓库未附带许可证
文件，其材料的一切权利归其作者所有。

Papers cited in `docs/` are referenced by title and arXiv/DOI link only; their
copyright belongs to their respective authors and publishers.

`docs/` 中引用的论文仅以标题与 arXiv/DOI 链接的形式出现，其著作权归各自的
作者与出版方所有。
